NOTE ON THE DATA IN common/data/

This license covers the source code in this repository. It does NOT cover the
aviation dataset.

The files under common/data/raw/ and the files they generate under
common/data/src/*.generated.ts are derived from the OpenFlights dataset
(https://github.com/jpatokal/openflights), which is licensed under the Open
Database License (ODbL) v1.0. Those files remain under the ODbL, which is
incompatible with the MIT terms above.

The ODbL requires attribution and is share-alike for derived databases. If you
redistribute this dataset or a derivative of it, you must carry the attribution
and keep those files under the ODbL. The full licence text is at
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/.

Because those files are data rather than code, and the application reads them at
build time rather than linking against them, the MIT licence is unaffected for
the code.
